flowchart LR
  START[Performance Workflow] --> MEASURE[Measure]
  MEASURE --> IDENTIFY[Identify Bottleneck]
  IDENTIFY --> FIX[Fix]
  FIX --> VERIFY[Verify]
  VERIFY --> MEASURE

  MEASURE --> TOOLS[Profiling Tools]
  TOOLS --> JFR[JDK Flight Recorder]
  TOOLS --> JMC[Java Mission Control]
  TOOLS --> AP[Async Profiler]
  TOOLS --> VV[VisualVM]
  TOOLS --> JJ[JProfiler / YourKit]
  TOOLS --> IJ[IntelliJ Profiler]

  IDENTIFY --> HEAP[Heap Analysis]
  HEAP --> MAT[Eclipse MAT]
  MAT --> DT[Domination Tree]
  MAT --> LSR[Leak Suspect Report]
  MAT --> GCR[GC Roots]
  MAT --> OQL[OQL Queries]
  IDENTIFY --> TD[Thread Dumps]
  TD --> JSTACK[jstack]
  TD --> DL[Deadlock Detection]
  TD --> CONT[Contention Analysis]

  FIX --> ANTIP[Anti-Patterns]
  ANTIP --> AB[Auto-boxing in Loops]
  ANTIP --> SC[String Concat in Loops]
  ANTIP --> ES[Excessive Synchronization]
  ANTIP --> N1[N+1 Queries]
  ANTIP --> CPL[Connection Pool Leaks]
  FIX --> GC[GC Tuning]
  GC --> G1[G1GC]
  GC --> ZGC[ZGC]
  GC --> SH[Shallow vs Retained Heap]
  FIX --> JVM[JVM Flags]
  JVM --> HS[Heap Sizing]
  JVM --> MM[Metaspace]
  JVM --> CCS[Code Cache]

  VERIFY --> JMH[JMH Benchmarks]
  JMH --> BM[Benchmark Annotation]
  JMH --> ST[State]
  JMH --> BH[Blackhole]
  JMH --> PM[Profiler Mode]

  MEASURE --> SB[Spring Boot Perf]
  SB --> LI[Lazy Initialization]
  SB --> CPT[Connection Pool Tuning]
  SB --> AOT[Ahead-of-Time Compilation]
  SB --> GS[Graceful Shutdown]
  SB --> VT[Virtual Threads]
